{"title":"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samantha receives the following marks out of 100 in seven of her eight courses:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b\">2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c\">2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211529\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19